    <description>Validates input category code, field type, and letter. Outputs appropriate letter, updated category code, and appropriate CAP__c.RecordId.
Checkbox field type letter is equal to &apos;X&apos;.
SKIP field type letter is equal to &apos;Z&apos;.
Radio Button field type letter is equal to input letter.</description>
